vendor/ -- what is lifted, from where, and what we changed
==========================================================

The rule (spec.md §12): lifts live here, tracked to a named upstream commit, with local changes
kept as a patch series rather than edited in place. Anything that could not be expressed as a
patch was REWRITTEN into core/ under our own name instead, so this directory stays updatable.
The bottom half of this file is the list of things that went the other way, and why -- that list
is as much a part of the record as the lifts are.

UPSTREAM
--------

